  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Gcd 103.05 Quorum. A quorum shall consist of a simple majority of members appointed, including participants by speakerphone or other telecommunication device if such means of attendance is required as an accommodation for a disability.\n\nSource. #7634, eff 1-30-02; ss by #10338, eff 5-17-13; ss by #12867, eff 9-20-19",
